TEXT -2720 576 Left 2 ;I added a lot of capacitors for individual components in the kicad, which are all put here
TEXT -2872 2696 Left 2 ;confirmed in Microchip's data sheet DS22267A). 86/103/103 give 2.63/2.37/2.37 A peaks.\nParts named SIM_ exist only in the simulation (battery, cable, LEDs, Arduino outputs).\nDimming runs (IREFn_DUTY below 256) can stop advancing while all LEDs are off (log fills with\n"tolerance relaxed" at one time). Adding solver=alt to the .options line got past it (2-3x slower).
